  "Vypočítaj $S_{xx}=\\sum x_i^2-n\\bar{x}^2$.": "Calcola $S_{xx}=\\sum x_i^2-n\\bar{x}^2$.",
  "Vypočítaj $S_{xx}=\\sum(x_i-\\bar{x})^2$.": "Calcola $S_{xx}=\\sum(x_i-\\bar{x})^2$.",
